                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "503cddcc-18a5-42df-bdc8-3029fd59858d",
                                "sense_id": "7c19b9c5-ed1e-3741-9b1e-1b191b8e2105",
                                "text": "Ten typowy bikiniarz w bajecznie kolorowym krawacie, o niespokojnych wijących się ruchach, ubrany w eleganckie, za szpiegowski żołd nabyte ubranie, […]",
                                "translation": "This typical stilyaga in his fantastically colorful necktie and his restless, writing movement, dressed in elegant clothes paid for with his spy salary, […]",
